{"catalog":[{"close":")","id":"pair.paren","kind":"pair","open":"(","where":"anywhere"},{"close":"}","id":"pair.brace","kind":"pair","open":"{","where":"anywhere"},{"close":">","id":"pair.include-angle","kind":"pair","open":"<","where":"include-line"},{"id":"key.$","key":"$","kind":"key"},{"id":"key..","key":".","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.0","key":"0","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.G","key":"G","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.O","key":"O","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.d","key":"d","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.f","key":"f","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.i","key":"i","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.j","key":"j","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.k","key":"k","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.o","key":"o","kind":"key"},{"id":"key.x","key":"x","kind":"key"}],"units":{"start":{"beats":[{"id":"fullscreen-ask","needs":"fullscreen-key","stage":"empty","say":"開始之前，建議先按 {fullscreen}，把畫面放到全螢幕喔！"},{"id":"fullscreen-yes","needs":"fullscreen-key","stage":"empty","when":"fullscreen","say":"哇，已經是全螢幕了！真棒！"},{"id":"fullscreen-no","needs":"fullscreen-key","stage":"empty","when":"windowed","say":"好吧，那我們就這樣開始吧。"},{"id":"intro","stage":"empty","say":"好的，那就讓我們從第一步開始吧！"},{"append":true,"id":"see-template","stage":"code","say":"看看這些東東。"},{"id":"line-include","lines":"1","stage":"code","say":"一行 include 萬能標頭檔。"},{"id":"line-using","lines":"2","stage":"code","say":"一行用來讓我們少打 std:: 的東東。"},{"auto":3000,"id":"line-main","lines":"4","stage":"code","say":"然後是我們的主函式。"},{"append":true,"id":"line-braces","lines":"5,6,7","stage":"code","say":"未來大部分東西都會放在 {} 這裡面。"},{"id":"line-fastio","lines":"6","stage":"code","say":"還有輸入輸出加速。"},{"id":"lost","stage":"code","say":"完全聽不懂嗎？"},{"append":true,"id":"never-mind","stage":"code","say":"沒關係！聽不懂才是正常的！完全不用擔心！"},{"id":"every-program","stage":"code","say":"接下來它們會不斷地以這個樣子出現，"},{"append":true,"id":"lets-type","stage":"code","say":"所以，來輸入一遍，熟悉一下吧！"},{"demo":"reset demo","id":"demo-intro","stage":"drill","say":"開始之前，先來看一遍示範吧！"},{"id":"vim-what","stage":"drill","say":"vim 是一種只需要用鍵盤就能寫程式的方式，同時也是一種哲學。"},{"append":true,"demo":"flash show:insert wait wait show:normal","id":"vim-two-modes","stage":"drill","say":"vim 有兩種模式：NORMAL 與 INSERT。"},{"id":"normal-is","stage":"drill","say":"normal 是一般模式，用來閱讀與下指令。"},{"append":true,"demo":"down:a key:a up:a down:b key:b up:b down:c key:c up:c","id":"normal-readonly","stage":"drill","say":"在這個模式下，只能讀取，沒辦法輸入文字。"},{"demo":"hint","id":"press-i","stage":"drill","unlock":["key.i"],"say":"如果想要輸入文字的話，就需要按 i 切換成輸入模式。"},{"demo":"hush down:i key:i up:i","id":"insert-is","stage":"drill","say":"切換成輸入模式了，這樣就能打字了！"},{"demo":"hint","id":"shift-combo","stage":"drill","say":"有些符號要先按住 Shift，使用組合鍵來輸入，像是這個 # 就是 Shift + 3。"},{"after":"next","demo":"down:Shift wait down:3 hush key:# up:3 wait up:Shift wait fill wait","id":"speed-run","stage":"drill","say":"剩下的，就讓我們一口氣打完吧！"},{"demo":"hint wait down:Escape esc up:Escape","id":"press-esc","stage":"drill","say":"打完之後，按左上角的 Esc，就會回到一般模式。"},{"demo":"live","id":"type-template","stage":"drill","wait":"drill","say":"就是這樣！來試試看吧！"},{"id":"do-things","stage":"run","unlock":["pair.include-angle","pair.paren","pair.brace"],"say":"接下來，該讓程式正式運作了！"},{"id":"editor","stage":"run","say":"接下來，從剛才寫好的東西繼續。"},{"id":"add-cout","snippet":"cout << 11;","stage":"run","say":"請幫我輸入這行東東，他的效果是輸出一個東西。"},{"id":"watch-edit","keys":["reset"],"say":"一樣，先來看一次示範吧！","snippet":"cout << 11;","stage":"run"},{"id":"where-it-goes","keys":[],"say":"這行東東，要放在最後一個 } 的上面。","snippet":"cout << 11;","stage":"run"},{"id":"go-end","keys":["G"],"say":"在一般模式按shift+g輸入大寫的G，游標會跳到最後一行，這就是vim的特別之處。","snippet":"cout << 11;","stage":"run","unlock":["key.G"]},{"id":"open-above","keys":["O"],"say":"再按 Shift + o 輸入大寫的 O，上面就會多出新的一行，而且直接切換成輸入模式，馬上就能輸入。","snippet":"cout << 11;","stage":"run","unlock":["key.O"]},{"id":"indent","keys":[],"say":"新的一行前面，已經自動空出四格了。這叫做縮排，現在只需要知道它會自動排好就行了！","snippet":"cout << 11;","stage":"run"},{"id":"semicolon","keys":["type:cout << 11;"],"say":"然後輸入這行東東。每一句的最後面都要加上分號 ; ，代表這一句結束了。","snippet":"cout << 11;","stage":"run"},{"id":"what-run","keys":["Esc","run"],"say":"輸入完之後，按 Esc 回到一般模式。然後按 Enter 執行，程式就會照著我們寫的內容運作。","snippet":"cout << 11;","stage":"run"},{"expect":"11","id":"run-cout","say":"來試試看吧！把這行東東加進去。先想一想畫面上會出現什麼，再執行！","snippet":"cout << 11;","stage":"run","wait":"run"},{"id":"saw-output","stage":"run","say":"有看到 11 嗎？這就是 cout 的效果：把東西輸出到畫面上。"},{"id":"arrows-out","stage":"run","say":"中間的 << 像兩個箭頭，把 11 送到 cout 那邊去。"},{"id":"add-second","snippet":"cout << 11;\ncout << 22;","stage":"run","say":"接下來，再多輸出一個 22 吧！"},{"id":"below-this-time","keys":["reset"],"say":"這次要加在剛才那一行的下面。","snippet":"cout << 11;\ncout << 22;","stage":"run"},{"id":"open-below","keys":["o"],"say":"按小寫的 o，下面就會多出新的一行，一樣會直接切換成輸入模式。","snippet":"cout << 11;\ncout << 22;","stage":"run","unlock":["key.o"]},{"id":"up-and-down","keys":[],"say":"大寫的 O 往上，小寫的 o 往下，只需要知道這樣就行了！","snippet":"cout << 11;\ncout << 22;","stage":"run"},{"id":"type-second","keys":["type:cout << 22;","Esc"],"say":"輸入這行東東，再按 Esc 回到一般模式。","snippet":"cout << 11;\ncout << 22;","stage":"run"},{"expect":"1122","id":"run-two","say":"來試試看吧！加上這一行。一樣先想一想畫面上會出現什麼，再執行！","snippet":"cout << 11;\ncout << 22;","stage":"run","wait":"run"},{"id":"stuck-together","stage":"run","say":"結果是 1122，兩個數字黏在一起。和我們想的一樣嗎？"},{"id":"honest","stage":"run","say":"這是因為我們沒有讓程式換行。程式只會做我們寫出來的事。"},{"id":"newline","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run","say":"換行也要自己輸出，寫法是 '\\n'。"},{"id":"quote-keys","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run","say":"單引號 ' 在 Enter 的左邊，反斜線 \\ 在 Enter 的上面。"},{"id":"where-newline","keys":["reset"],"say":"'\\n' 要加在分號的前面。","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"id":"line-end","keys":["$"],"say":"按 Shift + 4 輸入 $，游標會跳到這一行的最後面，剛好停在分號上。","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run","unlock":["key.$"]},{"id":"insert-before","keys":["i","type: << '\\n'","Esc"],"say":"按 i 切換成輸入模式，會從游標的前面開始輸入，所以輸入的東西剛好在分號的前面。","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"id":"repeat-ask","keys":[],"say":"上面那一行也要加上一樣的東西。不過，不用再輸入一次喔！","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"id":"go-up","keys":["k"],"say":"按 k，游標會往上一行。","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run","unlock":["key.k"]},{"id":"repeat","keys":["$","."],"say":"按 Shift + 4 輸入 $ 到最後面，再按 . ，剛才輸入的東西就會自動再輸入一次。","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run","unlock":["key.."]},{"id":"repeat-point","keys":[],"say":"只按了三個鍵，就完成了剛才那一整串輸入。這就是 vim 的特別之處！","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"expect":"11\n22","id":"run-newline","say":"來試試看吧！把兩行都改成這樣。先想一想這次會出現什麼，再執行！","snippet":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","stage":"run","wait":"run"},{"id":"each-line","stage":"run","say":"這次 11 和 22 各佔一行了！以後每輸出完一行，都要加上 '\\n'。"},{"id":"remember-number","stage":"run","say":"接下來，來把一個數字存起來吧！"},{"id":"int-explained","snippet":"int a{11};\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","say":"int 是整數的意思，a 是我們幫它取的名字，大括號裡面放的是它一開始的值。"},{"id":"old-lines","keys":["reset"],"say":"原本的兩行用不到了，先把它們刪掉吧！","snippet":"int a{11};\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"id":"delete-lines","keys":["dj"],"say":"按 d 再按 j，游標所在的這一行和下面那一行就會一起被刪掉。","snippet":"int a{11};\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","unlock":["key.d","key.j"]},{"id":"delete-point","keys":[],"say":"只按了兩個鍵，兩行就一起刪掉了，完全不用一個字一個字刪！","snippet":"int a{11};\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"id":"retype","keys":["O","type:int a{11};"],"say":"再按大寫的 O 往上開一行，輸入第一行東東。","snippet":"int a{11};\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"id":"next-line","keys":["Enter","type:cout << a << '\\n';","Esc"],"say":"在輸入模式按 Enter，就會換到下一行，接著輸入第二行東東。","snippet":"int a{11};\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"expect":"11","id":"run-int","say":"來試試看吧！把原本的兩行換成這兩行。先想一想會輸出什麼，再執行！","snippet":"int a{11};\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","wait":"run"},{"id":"from-a","stage":"run","say":"輸出的還是 11，不過這次的 11 是從 a 裡面取出來的。"},{"id":"variable","stage":"run","say":"像 a 這樣可以放東西的名字，叫做變數。"},{"id":"listen","stage":"run","say":"最後一樣東西，是輸入東西給程序。"},{"id":"cin-explained","snippet":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","say":"cin 會把我們輸入的數字，放進我們指定的變數裡。"},{"id":"arrows-in","snippet":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","say":"這次箭頭的方向反過來了，是從 cin 送進 a。"},{"id":"empty-braces","snippet":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","say":"這次大括號裡面是空的，因為 a 的值等一下會由我們輸入。"},{"id":"line-start","keys":["reset","k","0"],"say":"先把 11 刪掉。按 k 往上一行，再按 0 回到這一行的最前面。","snippet":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","unlock":["key.0"]},{"id":"find-char","keys":["f1"],"say":"接著按 f 再按 1，游標就會往右跳到第一個 1 上面。","snippet":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","unlock":["key.f"]},{"id":"find-point","keys":[],"say":"f 加上任何一個字，游標就會直接跳到那個字，不用一格一格移動！","snippet":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"id":"delete-char","keys":["x","x"],"say":"按 x 會刪掉游標所在的那個字。按兩次，11 就刪掉了。","snippet":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","unlock":["key.x"]},{"id":"add-cin","keys":["o","type:cin >> a;","Esc"],"say":"然後按小寫的 o 往下開一行，輸入 cin 這一行。","snippet":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run"},{"expect":"42","id":"run-cin","say":"下面多了一格「輸入」，裡面的 42 會輸入給程式。把程式改好，先想一想會輸出什麼，再執行！","snippet":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","stage":"run","wait":"run","input":"42"},{"id":"echo","stage":"run","say":"輸入的是 42，輸出的也是 42：cin 把 42 放進 a，cout 再把 a 輸出。"},{"id":"recap","stage":"run","say":"到這裡，cout、'\\n'、int、cin 我們都用過了。"},{"id":"your-turn","stage":"run","say":"最後一題，這次沒有示範，來自己寫寫看吧！"},{"id":"two-vars","snippet":"輸入有兩個整數。請先印出第二個數，換行；再印出第一個數，換行。","stage":"run","say":"兩個數就需要兩個變數。第二個變數可以叫 b，寫法和 a 一樣。"},{"expect":"5\n3","id":"task","say":"下面的「輸入」是程式會收到的東西，「應該輸出」是正確的結果。照著上面的題目寫出程式，先在腦中跑一遍，再執行吧！","snippet":"輸入有兩個整數。請先印出第二個數，換行；再印出第一個數，換行。","stage":"run","wait":"run","input":"3 5"},{"id":"done","stage":"run","say":"做到了！我們已經會讓程式輸入、儲存、輸出了！"}],"starter":"#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main()\n{\n    cin.tie(nullptr)->sync_with_stdio(false);\n}","tasks":[{"demo":[{"id":"watch-edit","keys":[]},{"id":"where-it-goes","keys":[]},{"id":"go-end","keys":["G"],"teaches":["key.G"]},{"id":"open-above","keys":["O"],"teaches":["key.O"]},{"id":"indent","keys":[]},{"id":"semicolon","keys":["type:cout << 11;"]},{"id":"what-run","keys":["Esc","run"]}],"expect":"11","goal":"cout << 11;","id":"run-cout","show":"cout << 11;"},{"demo":[{"id":"below-this-time","keys":[]},{"id":"open-below","keys":["o"],"teaches":["key.o"]},{"id":"up-and-down","keys":[]},{"id":"type-second","keys":["type:cout << 22;","Esc"]}],"expect":"1122","goal":"cout << 11;\ncout << 22;","id":"run-two","show":"cout << 11;\ncout << 22;"},{"demo":[{"id":"where-newline","keys":[]},{"id":"line-end","keys":["$"],"teaches":["key.$"]},{"id":"insert-before","keys":["i","type: << '\\n'","Esc"]},{"id":"repeat-ask","keys":[]},{"id":"go-up","keys":["k"],"teaches":["key.k"]},{"id":"repeat","keys":["$","."],"teaches":["key.."]},{"id":"repeat-point","keys":[]}],"expect":"11\n22","goal":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';","id":"run-newline","show":"cout << 11 << '\\n';\ncout << 22 << '\\n';"},{"demo":[{"id":"old-lines","keys":[]},{"id":"delete-lines","keys":["dj"],"teaches":["key.d","key.j"]},{"id":"delete-point","keys":[]},{"id":"retype","keys":["O","type:int a{11};"]},{"id":"next-line","keys":["Enter","type:cout << a << '\\n';","Esc"]}],"expect":"11","goal":"int a{11};\ncout << a << '\\n';","id":"run-int","show":"int a{11};\ncout << a << '\\n';"},{"demo":[{"id":"line-start","keys":["k","0"],"teaches":["key.0"]},{"id":"find-char","keys":["f1"],"teaches":["key.f"]},{"id":"find-point","keys":[]},{"id":"delete-char","keys":["x","x"],"teaches":["key.x"]},{"id":"add-cin","keys":["o","type:cin >> a;","Esc"]}],"expect":"42","goal":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';","id":"run-cin","input":"42","show":"int a{};\ncin >> a;\ncout << a << '\\n';"},{"demo":[],"expect":"5\n3","goal":"int a{};\nint b{};\ncin >> a >> b;\ncout << b << '\\n';\ncout << a << '\\n';","id":"task","input":"3 5","show":"輸入有兩個整數。請先印出第二個數，換行；再印出第一個數，換行。"}]}},"version":"855a9c32021a9f7f"}